abstract: >-
  Dependency-free Python reference implementations of the primary TRACE-FV
  v2.1 scoring estimands, accompanied by synthetic data, expected outputs,
  tests, continuous integration, and a byte-identical archive of the public
  OSF Object A protocol package. This release contains no official pilot data.
